      <unicode>ᠨᠠᠮᠬᠠᠷᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>namqaraqu</uighur>
      <definition>To disappear. To cease. To end. To set one's mind at rest. To be or become quiet or undisturbed.</definition>
      <page>324</page>
